WEBVTT

00:11:28.876 --> 00:11:31.996
that this war stops immediately.

00:11:32.396 --> 00:11:34.076
Because if it doesn't,

00:11:34.076 --> 00:11:36.276
it's not only the Ukrainians
and the Russians

00:11:36.276 --> 00:11:37.956
that will suffer terribly.

00:11:37.996 --> 00:11:41.916
Everybody will suffer terribly
if this war continues.

00:11:42.876 --> 00:11:44.196
BG: Explain why.

00:11:45.316 --> 00:11:49.356
YNH: Because of the shock waves
destabilizing the whole world.

00:11:49.396 --> 00:11:51.476
Let’s start with the bottom line:

00:11:51.876 --> 00:11:53.076
budgets.

00:11:53.116 --> 00:11:57.396
We have been living in an amazing era
of peace in the last few decades.

00:11:57.436 --> 00:12:00.316
And it wasn't some kind of hippie fantasy.